; Dogfooding v1/v2: LOOM decides whether one candidate has all three facts
; required by our development discipline.
;
; The role quorum is checker-enforced. V1 accepts an unverified manual count;
; v2 pins this exact source and derives the count from Git, CI and signed review.

(defx main () (fn (evidence_quorum)
  (if (= evidence_quorum 3)
    (trust (roles code spec proof)
      (by code developer
        (by spec operator
          (by proof citadel 1))))
    0)))
